# data/cache/ is committed on purpose. It holds public API responses (NASA POWER, Qatar Open Data, SoilGrids,
# AquaCrop, OSM, cadastral layer metadata) with retrieval dates, so the demo works offline. No credentials.
# Cadastral *viewport* caches are excluded: they are keyed by an arbitrary map bounding box, so they are test
# artifacts that never repeat for another user, and they account for 16 MB of a 17 MB cache directory.
data/cache/cadastre_bbox_*.json
data/cache/cadastre_ids_*.json
